<title>DUBAI: Aramco raises A-960 bunkers ex-Jeddah/Yanbu.</title>
<headline>Aramco raises A-960 bunkers ex-Jeddah/Yanbu.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Aramco said on Wednesday it had increased its A-960 bunker fuel oil price from the Red Sea ports of Jeddah and Yanbu by $1 a tonne to $94 with effect July 10.</p>
<p>Aramco kept its other bunker prices unchanged at $102 a tonne for A-960 lifting from Ras Tanura and Dammam and $199 for A-888 from the two Gulf ports.</p>
<p>A-888 from Jeddah and Yanbu remains at $180 a tonne.</p>
</text>
